  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/sub_046.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/sub_046.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_01",
      "hash64": "AF56210A305FD036",
      "text": "要让我看看\\n你和宝可梦有多友好吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_02",
      "hash64": "AF56200A305FCE83",
      "text": "要让我看你和哪只宝可梦\\n有多友好呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_03",
      "hash64": "AF561F0A305FCCD0",
      "text": "让我看看哦……[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你和\\n[VAR 0x0102(0001)]的友好程度是……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0102",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_04",
      "hash64": "AF56260A305FD8B5",
      "text": "最佳拍档非你们莫属！！\\n和彼此在一起就会很幸福吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_05",
      "hash64": "AF56250A305FD702",
      "text": "你们的关系好得没话说！\\n而且彼此都很珍惜对方呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_06",
      "hash64": "AF56240A305FD54F",
      "text": "嗯！你们俩非常友好！\\n能互相陪伴在身边，看起来好开心！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_07",
      "hash64": "AF56230A305FD39C",
      "text": "你们看起来感情不错呢。\\n但是你们应该还能变得更亲密！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_08",
      "hash64": "AF562A0A305FDF81",
      "text": "你们有一点点友好！\\n今后一定会越来越好的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_09",
      "hash64": "AF56290A305FDDCE",
      "text": "嗯～你们的关系不好不坏！\\n好期待今后的发展呀！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_10",
      "hash64": "AF529C0A305CB860",
      "text": "你是不是与它相遇还没多久呀？\\n在一起时还有些尴尬？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_11",
      "hash64": "AF529D0A305CBA13",
      "text": "你们是怎么回事嘛！？\\n竟然一点也不友好……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_12",
      "hash64": "AF529E0A305CBBC6",
      "text": "作为友好的证明！\\n让我为它戴上这个好东西吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_046_system_01",
      "hash64": "4DBAA28FEF755C82",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0102(0001)]\\n戴上了好友奖章！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0102",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_13",
      "hash64": "AF529F0A305CBD79",
      "text": "欢迎随时来给我看宝可梦哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sub_046_child_f_14",
      "hash64": "AF52A00A305CBF2C",
      "text": "和宝可梦在一起的话，\\n你们就会慢慢变得友好起来。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
